subckt sar8_se_store CK DATA RESET VDD VSS Q
XDR (DATA RESET DIN VDD VSS) OR2D1BWP12T30P140
XCLR (RESET RST_N VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
XREG (DIN CK RST_N Q VDD VSS) DFCNQD1BWP12T30P140
